      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "A `devices` resource represents the iOS, Apple TV, Apple Watch, and Mac devices that you register to use for development and testing. You can register a limited number of new devices and get information about them.",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "> **Note**\n>\n>  You can only remove registered devices through the Apple Developer website.",
          "refs": []
        }
